<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila firms seek additional 10,000T beef imports.</title>
<headline>Manila firms seek additional 10,000T beef imports.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine food processors want to import an additional 10,000 tonnes of frozen beef this year, an agriculture official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The additional request was on top of the 57,054 tonnes of imported beef allowed by the government to be brought into the country at lesser tariffs this year,&quot; the official, who asked not to be identified, told Reuters.</p>
</text>
